    License: Apache License 2.0
             https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
    Source:  https://jena.apache.org/documentation/fuseki2/
    The default triplestore Digicities ships with as of v0.3. Fully
    OSI-approved. Datasets are provisioned lazily per workspace via Fuseki's
    admin REST API.

  Ontotext GraphDB Free (ontotext/graphdb:10.7.3)  [OPT-IN OVERLAY]
    License: GraphDB Free License Agreement (proprietary, gratis)
             https://www.ontotext.com/products/graphdb/license/
    NOTE: GraphDB Free is NOT open-source software. Use only enabled when
    the user adds docker-compose.graphdb.yml to COMPOSE_FILE in .env and
    sets TRIPLESTORE_BACKEND=graphdb. Use of the container is governed by
    Ontotext's End User License Agreement, accepted on first launch. The
    Digicities platform itself remains Apache 2.0; setting up this overlay
    is the user's deliberate choice. Use it if you want GraphDB's richer
    Workbench UI or inference; stick with the Fuseki default if you need a
